---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="点心 · 一根儿火柴"
  description="点心：一个慢慢长大的个人网站。心理学在读，偶尔写点东西，偶尔做点实验。"
>
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="intro">
      <p class="brand">点心 <span class="brand-en">DIANDIANXIN</span></p>

      <h1 class="name">一根儿火柴</h1>

      <p class="tagline">心理学在读，偶尔写点东西。</p>

      <nav class="intro-nav" aria-label="站内导航">
        <a href="#grow">这里会长出</a>
        <a href="#now">最近在做</a>
        <a href="#contact">联系</a>
      </nav>

      <footer class="intro-foot">
        <a href="mailto:hi@diandianxin.com">hi@diandianxin.com</a>
      </footer>
    </header>

    <main class="content">
      <section class="opening" aria-label="开场">
        <p class="lead">你好，我是点心。</p>
        <p class="copy">心理学在读，偶尔写点东西，偶尔做点实验和小工具。</p>
        <p class="copy">
          「点心」是两件事：一是吃的点心——用吃块点心的工夫，随手看点东西；
          二是火堆的芯——底下的火不灭。
        </p>
        <p class="copy">一根儿火柴，点燃自己，也帮别人把火引起来。</p>
      </section>

      <section id="grow" class="section" aria-labelledby="grow-title">
        <h2 id="grow-title" class="section-title">这里会长出</h2>

        <ol class="items">
          <li class="item">
            <span class="item-no">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">想法与随笔</h3>
              <p class="item-desc">心理学视角看日常。写那些想不明白、但值得想的事。</p>
              <span class="status">筹备中</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="item">
            <span class="item-no">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">知识汇总</h3>
              <p class="item-desc">把读过的论文和书，整理成能直接用的东西。</p>
              <span class="status">筹备中</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="item">
            <span class="item-no">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">可交互实验</h3>
              <p class="item-desc">把心理学里的经典实验，做成能亲手玩一遍的小程序。</p>
              <span class="status">筹备中</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="item">
            <span class="item-no">04</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">心理测验</h3>
              <p class="item-desc">不是娱乐测试，是认真设计、有据可依的自我探索。</p>
              <span class="status">筹备中</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section id="now" class="section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
        <h2 id="now-title" class="section-title">最近在做</h2>

        <ul class="timeline">
          <li>
            <time datetime="2026-11-03">2026.11.03</time>
            <span>网站动工：骨架搭起来了，本站正式开工。</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <time datetime="2026-11">2026.11</time>
            <span>第一批「想法与随笔」正在整理中。</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" class="section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <h2 id="contact-title" class="section-title">联系</h2>
        <p class="copy">想聊点什么，或者想一起做点东西，写信给我。</p>
        <p class="copy">
          <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:hi@diandianxin.com">hi@diandianxin.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
